Package: fedstatAPIr
Title: Unofficial API for Fedstat (Rosstat EMISS System) for Automatic and Efficient Data Queries
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Denis",
           family = "Krylov",
	       role =c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "deniskrylovvit@gmail.com"),
    person(given = "Dmitry",
           family = "Kibalnikov",
	       role =c("aut"),
           email = "d.kibalnikov@gmail.com")     
    )  
Description: Downloads indicator data from Fedstat (EMISS), the Russian official
    statistics portal <https://www.fedstat.ru>. Large selections are downloaded in
    small, paced parts that are saved to disk and resume after interruptions.
    Also lists the filters and the code dictionaries of indicators.
